OL,3,GNEWSAIreland and Ukraine considering
OL,4,Aco-production of unmanned drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FIreland's Taoiseach (prime minister)
OL,7,Fand the Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,8,FZelensky have indicated that they may
OL,9,Fcooperate on the production of unmanned
OL,10,Fdrones.
OL,12,FThe two leaders met in Dublin on
OL,13,FWednesday ahead of a meeting of
OL,14,FEuropean leaders on Thursday.
OL,16,FSpeaking at a press conference,
OL,17,FZelensky indicated a willingness to
OL,18,Fwork with the Irish government in the
OL,19,Fco-production of drones.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
