OL,3,GNEWSAIreland and Ukraine considering
OL,4,Aco-production of unmanned drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe taoiseach said work is ongoing
OL,7,Fbetween the two sides given Ukraine's
OL,8,Fexpertise on drone technology and that
OL,9,Fthe Irish are considering agreeing a
OL,10,Fmemorandum with Ukraine on the issue.
